.Dd October 29, 2026
.Dt VSDBUTIL 8
.Os Minkar
.Sh NAME
.Nm vsdbutil
.Nd turn the use of permissions on a volume on or off
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Fl a Ar path
.Nm
.Fl c Ar path
.Nm
.Fl d Ar path
.Nm
.Fl i
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
acts on the volume
.Ar path
is on.
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl a Ar path
Adopt the files' owners and permissions: the volume is mounted again with
.Cm owners .
.It Fl c Ar path
Show whether the volume uses them.
.It Fl d Ar path
Disown them: the volume is mounted again with
.Cm noowners ,
and its files belong to whoever uses them.
.It Fl i
Fill the database of volumes' settings; Minkar keeps no such database
yet, and this does nothing.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr mount 8
